      <definition>n. Rest, repose, relaxation; vacation.</definition>
      <page>41</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠮᠤᠷᠠᠯᠲᠠ ᠪᠡᠷ ᠶᠠᠪᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
