          <definition>Regular leave of absence, vacation.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠮᠤᠷᠠᠯᠲᠠ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠡᠳᠦᠷ</unicode>
